---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Background and experience of a UK-based CTO and technology consultant.">
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p class="lead">Technology leader with a passion for building scalable systems and enabling engineering teams.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-content">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-text">
          <h2>Background</h2>
          <p>
            I am a UK-based technology executive and software engineer with extensive experience
            designing cloud-native architectures, integrating AI-powered workflows, and leading
            engineering teams through complex technical transformations.
          </p>
          <p>
            My work spans from hands-on development of APIs and automation platforms to strategic
            technology planning, team mentorship, and establishing engineering best practices across organisations.
          </p>

          <h2>Technical Focus</h2>
          <p>
            I specialise in cloud infrastructure on Google Cloud Platform and AWS, Python-based
            backend development with FastAPI, and incorporating large language models into production
            systems. I maintain a security-first approach and have deep experience with DevSecOps
            practices, vulnerability management, and compliance-ready architectures.
          </p>

          <h2>Leadership Philosophy</h2>
          <p>
            I believe that strong engineering outcomes come from clear communication, well-defined
            processes, and empowering teams to take ownership of their work. Whether acting as
            fractional CTO, technical advisor, or hands-on development lead, I focus on delivering
            measurable results while building sustainable engineering cultures.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding: 6rem 0 3rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, var(--color-secondary) 100%);
    color: var(--color-surface);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-hero .lead {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .about-content {
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }

  .about-text h2 {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .about-text h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .about-text p {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-hero h1 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
